---
locale: en
title: about
eleventyNavigation:
  key: About-en
  title: about
  order: 3
permalink: /en/about/index.html
---
<h1>Meet the team</h1>

<p class="about-hero-text">We are a passionate team of explorers, historians, and storytellers dedicated to uncovering the world's most breathtaking wonders.</p>

<div class="centered-logo-wrapper">
	<img src="/img/logo.png" alt="trAIlblazers Logo" class="large-centered-logo">
</div>

<section class="authors-grid">
	{% for key, author in authors %}
	<div class="author-card">
		<div class="author-card-avatar-wrapper">
			<img src="{{ author.avatar }}" alt="{{ author.name }}" class="author-card-avatar">
		</div>
		<div class="author-card-content">
			<h2>{{ author.name }}</h2>
			<p>{{ author.bio[locale] }}</p>
			<a href="/{{ locale }}/authors/{{ key }}/" class="author-archive-link">{{ 'posts_by' | i18n({}, locale) }} {{ author.name }} &rarr;</a>
		</div>
	</div>
	{% endfor %}
</section>

<style>
.about-hero-text {
	text-align: center;
	font-size: 1.25rem;
	max-width: 800px;
	margin: 0 auto 2rem; /* Reduced margin to bring logo closer */
	color: var(--color-text);
	opacity: 0.8;
}

.centered-logo-wrapper {
	display: flex;
	justify-content: center;
	margin-bottom: 5rem;
}

.large-centered-logo {
	width: 220px;
	height: 220px;
	object-fit: contain;
	border-radius: 50%;
	box-shadow: 0 15px 45px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
	border: 5px solid var(--color-secondary);
	transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
}

.large-centered-logo:hover {
	transform: scale(1.05) rotate(3deg);
}

.authors-grid {
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: column;
	gap: 3rem;
	margin-bottom: 4rem;
}

.author-card {
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	gap: 3rem;
	background: var(--card-bg);
	padding: 3rem;
	border-radius: 32px;
	box-shadow: var(--shadow);
	border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
}

.author-card-avatar-wrapper {
	flex-shrink: 0;
}

.author-card-avatar {
	width: 200px;
	height: 200px;
	max-width: none;
	border-radius: 50%;
	object-fit: cover;
	border: 6px solid var(--color-secondary);
	box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

.author-card-content h2 {
	margin-top: 0;
	border: none;
	font-size: 2rem;
	color: var(--color-primary);
}

.author-card-content p {
	font-size: 1.1rem;
	line-height: 1.6;
}

.author-archive-link {
	display: inline-block;
	margin-top: 1.5rem;
	font-weight: 700;
	color: var(--color-secondary) !important;
	text-decoration: none;
	transition: all 0.3s ease;
	font-family: var(--font-family-headings);
	text-transform: uppercase;
	letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.author-archive-link:hover {
	color: var(--color-primary) !important;
	text-decoration: underline;
}

@media (max-width: 800px) {
	.author-card {
		flex-direction: column;
		text-align: center;
		padding: 2rem;
	}
	
	.author-card-avatar {
		width: 150px;
		height: 150px;
	}
}
</style>
